            <div xml:id="d146">

                <pb facs="0171" n="159" sameAs="frus:frus1940v03/pg159"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">345.1121 Benz, Heinrich/18: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Calcutta</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Groth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Calcutta</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-02-10T09:00:00+05:53">February 10,
                            1941—9 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 7:04 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Reference Department’s telegram of October 4, 8 p.m. Heinrich Benz departed
                    Calcutta as member of crew of SS <hi rendition="#italic">Explorer</hi> due at
                    New York about March 12.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Groth</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
